  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tulip Business Incubator</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moldova&#x2019;s private sector faces several challenges including limited access to capital and lack of business development services. This applies particularly to the country&#x2019;s young people who struggle to transform their bright ideas into sustainable ventures. This project aims to address these gaps through the provision of capacity building, mentorship and financial support. By equipping youth with essential resources, this project contributes to fostering a generation of confident and innovative entrepreneurs, ready to drive Moldova&#x2019;s private sector development.</narrative>
  </description>
